<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_725_1813.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser freündtlich willig diennst. unnd was wir Eren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermögen zuovor Ersamen und weisen.
<lb n="3"/>besonnder lieb unnd guoten freündt. Verganngner
<lb n="4"/>tagen, haben wir ainen E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. W. mitinwoner
<lb n="5"/>mit namen <persName resp="#ner">Joachim Ruedger</persName>, Kürßner hanndwerckhs.
<lb n="6"/>ains fräuels halber. so er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beganngen</unclear>.
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brauich</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgestellt</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">6</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfunndt</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfenning</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urtel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestrafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebueßt</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bald</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pflicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemmen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachmals</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bürgen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volgents</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepürender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerlegen</unclear>.
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buoß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelaißtet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstattet</unclear> worden. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ist</unclear> er doch gleich denn selben
<lb n="15"/>tag. Unbedacht unnsers rathsknechts und seiner
<lb n="16"/>ufferlegten vertröstung unnd bezalung deß frä-
<lb n="17"/>uels. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinweg</unclear> gezogen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichwol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maister</unclear>. alda er gearbeijt. disen abschidt
<lb n="19"/>hinder Ime verlassen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachdem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> wie gehört.
<lb n="20"/>von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestrafft</unclear>. unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> gelt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfaßt</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wäre</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhaims</unclear> ziehen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>seinen verwanndten uffbringen. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volgends</unclear> der
<lb n="23"/>urtel statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuog</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inmassen</unclear> wir unns dann
<lb n="24"/>nit anderst versehen. söllchs wie billich beschehen
<lb n="25"/>werd. Diewijl es sich aber bißdaher
<lb n="26"/>verzogen. Unnd villicht hinfürter weitter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergessenhait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stöllen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möcht</unclear>. Haben wir
<lb n="28"/>nit wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underlassen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künden</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear> E. W <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hand</unclear>-
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lung</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mainung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuberichten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear> unnd pitt. Wo gemelt-
<lb n="31"/>er Joachim <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ruedger</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhaims</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ald</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenwürtig</unclear>. sie
<lb n="32"/>wöllen mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">crafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberkhait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschaff</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obberuerten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urtel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachzuokommen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deth</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihenig</unclear>. so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufferlegt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würcklich</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvolnstreckhen</unclear> Wie wir dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichem</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/>faal. gegen E E W. zuthuon auch genaigt unnd schuldig
<lb n="37"/>wären. Das begeren wir umb
<lb n="38"/>dieselben. unnser besonnder lieb und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünt</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverdienen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear> den
<lb n="40"/><origDate when="1553" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Augustij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear> 53</origDate>.
<lb n="41"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-68" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Rath.
<lb n="42"/>der Statt Überlingen</orgName>.
